    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (fit tantrum scene conniption)
  entry
    definition "a sudden uncontrollable attack"
    examples ("a paroxysm of giggling" "a fit of coughing" "convulsions of laughter")
    id oewn-14106270-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (paroxysm fit convulsion)
  entry
    definition "the manner in which something fits"
    examples ("I admired the fit of her coat")
    id oewn-04937484-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (fit)
  entry
    definition "a sudden flurry of activity (often for no obvious reason)"
    examples ("a burst of applause" "a fit of housecleaning")
    id oewn-00556362-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (burst fit)
  entry
    definition "be agreeable or acceptable to"
